    "Echo (add-on): Curl 2x12, 2 a week, stated 10 minutes a session, 20 extra minutes a week. 2 sets: 6-12 100%, arm 100%.",
    "Watch: Alpha has 10 sessions of 33 min (watch average 33); Bravo only 3 (estimate). Ratio = median(33 / 28) = 1.1786 -> 1.18. Bravo 18 x 1.18 = 21.24 -> 21; Charlie 14 x 1.18 = 16.52 -> 17; Echo 10 x 1.18 = 11.8 -> 12.",
    "Alpha run 2025-01-05..2025-02-15 (41 days): squat early best 200x5 = 233.3 -> 233 (Jan 6), late 220x5 = 256.7 -> 257 (Feb 10); the Feb 12 Deload set (250x5) is left out. Change 24 / 233 = 10.3%. Too short (under 56 days) for VO2.",
