    "Current lifts: Squat stalled in 1-5, so programs whose main range is not 1-5 (Bravo, Charlie, Echo) get +0.1 strength.",
    "Alpha: strength profile min(1, (50 + 25) / 50) = 1, history clamp(0.5 + 10.3 / 20) = 1 -> 1.00; joint 0.5 x 0.5 + 0.3 x 1/3 + 0.2 x (1 - 0.75) = 0.40; weekly 3 x 33 = 99 -> time 1; vo2 0; completion 100 -> x1; total (1 + 0.4 + 1 + 0) / 4 = 0.60.",
    "Bravo: strength 20 / 50 = 0.4 + 0.1 = 0.50; joint 0.5 x 1 + 0.3 x 2/3 + 0.2 x 1 = 0.90; weekly 3 x 21 + 30 = 93 -> 1; vo2 (1 + clamp(0.5 + 2 / 2)) / 2 = 1; completion 60 -> x0.8; total 0.85 x 0.8 = 0.68.",
    "Charlie: strength 33.5 / 50 = 0.67 + 0.1 = 0.77; joint (0 + 0.3 x 2/3 + 0.2 x (1 - 33/40)) x 0.75 = 0.235 x 0.75 = 0.17625 -> 0.18; weekly 51 -> 1; vo2 1/3 -> 0.33; no runs -> x1; total (0.77 + 0.18 + 1 + 0.33) / 4 = 0.57.",
