    "Weights (variants): strength 3x, others 1x divides by 6. Alpha (3 x 1 + 0.4 + 1 + 0) / 6 = 0.733 -> 0.73; Charlie (3 x 0.77 + 0.18 + 1 + 0.33) / 6 = 3.82 / 6 = 0.637 -> 0.64; Bravo (3 x 0.5 + 0.9 + 1 + 1) / 6 x 0.8 = 0.587 -> 0.59.",
